  "summary": "The upgrade from Ubuntu 22.04 to 24.04 will introduce several changes and potential conflicts for the installed packages, including PostgreSQL, Samba, HAProxy, Squid, SSSD, systemd, GCC, Chrony, ClamAV, Django, and OpenSSH.",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The upgrade to Ubuntu 24.04 will break samba-ad-provision if its version is older than 2:4.19.5+dfsg.",
      "chunk_ids": [
        "apt-relations_24.04_samba"
      ],
      "category": "known_issue",
